{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:32 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:32 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:32 2026-10-15 HKT</p><p>葵涌大窩口邨發生扶手電梯意外。今日（15日）早上9時25分，一名八旬婆婆在富邦樓旁邊乘搭扶手電梯前往商場，其間她意外跌倒，頭髮捲入梯級被夾困。另一名伯伯同樣跌倒受傷，街坊見狀協助報案。救護員到場發現兩名傷者均清醒，將他們送院治理。</p><p>據了解，受傷兩人是夫婦關係，婆婆姓張（84歲），當時與同齡的姓林丈夫同行，懷疑林翁突然腳軟，她欲扶住不果，雙雙跌倒。張婦頭部擦傷，林翁則頭及腳擦傷、肩膊扭傷。涉事扶手電梯其後被圍封進行檢查。</p><img alt=\"大批消防到場施援。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/edc58a0fb0d5a01d3a7c67cf55899ce3/2026-10/01_1_25.jpg\"/><img alt=\"涉事扶手電梯被圍封檢查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/aaf22622adc34446a025c7fca88c67e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/10ef504e524e2dfde47a2eaaca849365/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2c45b799fb66573e138beb9843297ba4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e5c67730077914e8152dc1436bdde8eb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_07.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/677248b63f9cc81731eac4cd58ee76fe/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/22af715789ece3237402a10fe164015e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事扶手電梯需圍封檢查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e95f7a3aec9509560ac9fb96b325e6f1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7472dbb7fe47a7c15e3483b6aa52eb73/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_10_20_05.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.334627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":294,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:32:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:11.135103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:11.135103+00:00","content_hash":"107f4ff3d0a2aa3971db67a9be39f1b4ef969fdbd9e1d702bde689949eadbfae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}